 "summary": "This is a commercial office lease between Northwind Labs, Inc. (Tenant) and Lakeside Commons REIT, Inc. (Landlord) for 400 Harbor Street, Suite 12. It runs 36 months from 9 January 2026 at USD 144,000 per year, with a one-time five-year renewal option for Northwind, and is governed by Ontario law."
